[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 14583.269, "timestamp": "04:03:03", "text": "凉爽的。哇。通过结合棍子和什么东西"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14585.59, "timestamp": "04:03:05", "text": "它打来的电话？草。如何才能弄到草？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14588.87, "timestamp": "04:03:08", "text": "我们如何才能做到这一点？这叫做性虐待。是的，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14590.71, "timestamp": "04:03:10", "text": "这叫做性虐待。你插了一根棍子"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14592.87, "timestamp": "04:03:12", "text": "还有你屁股里的草。是的，棍子。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14594.71, "timestamp": "04:03:14", "text": "把草屑塞进你的屁股里。过来。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14597.11, "timestamp": "04:03:17", "text": "过来。过来。那只是一个"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14599.189, "timestamp": "04:03:19", "text": "是的。乐趣。鸡蛋攻击则完全不同。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14600.389, "timestamp": "04:03:20", "text": "事物。就是你把它塞进去的地方"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14602.389, "timestamp": "04:03:22", "text": "阴茎。不要靠近火源。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14604.07, "timestamp": "04:03:24", "text": "不要靠近。哦，原来是阴茎。我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14606.63, "timestamp": "04:03:26", "text": "我觉得就像你一样"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14609.349, "timestamp": "04:03:29", "text": "火。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14612.15, "timestamp": "04:03:32", "text": "它会变成木炭。你知道那个"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14616.229, "timestamp": "04:03:36", "text": "呃，一，呃，好的，现在我们像这样，或者我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14617.99, "timestamp": "04:03:37", "text": "不知道。但感觉就像是这个男孩"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14621.429, "timestamp": "04:03:41", "text": "不知怎么的，他把手机充电器塞进了自己体内"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14624.55, "timestamp": "04:03:44", "text": "阴茎。什么？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14626.469, "timestamp": "04:03:46", "text": "我不太确定为什么，但就像如果一个男孩得到"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14629.349, "timestamp": "04:03:49", "text": "他把手机充电器塞进了阴茎里。哦，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14631.189, "timestamp": "04:03:51", "text": "是的。你需要找到燧石。这是一个"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14633.91, "timestamp": "04:03:53", "text": "石头、树枝和草。我们可以制造"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14635.99, "timestamp": "04:03:55", "text": "一把斧头。制作一个燧石和钢片。哦，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14638.07, "timestamp": "04:03:58", "text": "好的。这里，这是一根棍子"}]